/**
 * Curated, watermark-free HD photo packs — bucketed per category.
 *
 * Sources: Burst (Shopify) and StockSnap — both CC0 / free-for-commercial,
 * no watermarks. Every URL was HTTP-checked (200, image/*, >=900px wide)
 * when this file was generated, so runtime never depends on a search API.
 *
 * Buckets let the apply step put the right kind of photo in the right slot:
 *  hero     — wide, atmospheric establishing shots
 *  gallery  — variety shots for galleries / portfolios
 *  service  — service / treatment / process close-ups
 *  product  — product, dish and item close-ups (menus, store cards)
 *  team     — people portraits for team / testimonial slots
 */

